{
  "declaredLength": 10272,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "It’s bad news time!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200062006100640020006E006500770073002000740069006D0065002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Listen, you won’t believe this—I found a hacked\nPoké Ball.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0069007300740065006E002C00200079006F007500200077006F006E20190074002000620065006C0069006500760065002000740068006900732014004900200066006F0075006E0064002000610020006800610063006B00650064000A0050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Poké Balls can be hacked?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C0073002000630061006E0020006200650020006800610063006B00650064003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What are you talking about?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000610072006500200079006F0075002000740061006C006B0069006E0067002000610062006F00750074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah. I suppose you wouldn’t know. Poké Ball\nhacking was something Team Flare looked into<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nback in the day.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOur scientists developed a way to infect a Poké\nBall with a computer virus and mess with it in<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndifferent ways—even render it unusable.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 253
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Awful, right?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nImagine what a nightmare it would’ve been for\nKalos if this technology got out.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And now it’s give-you-a-task time!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00640020006E006F00770020006900742019007300200067006900760065002D0079006F0075002D0061002D007400610073006B002000740069006D0065002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s the hacked Poké Ball. Would you believe\nit’s got the Pokémon called <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Volcanion<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> inside?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d love to know how a Mythical Pokémon that\nrare got caught in the first place, but I digress.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Since this Poké Ball’s hacked, it’s unusable now.\nI want to let Volcanion out, but once I do, well...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nVolcanion will be out. It’ll probably be battle time.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 163
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And that’s your time to shine, lackey!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOnce I set Volcanion loose, catch it again—but in\na ball that actually works this time!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let me know when you’re ready to take on and\ncatch Volcanion!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F00770020007700680065006E00200079006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200074006F002000740061006B00650020006F006E00200061006E0064000A0063006100740063006800200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ready to take on Volcanion? Got the right\nPokémon and items with you? Got the guts?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, I got ’em",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C0020004900200067006F0074002020190065006D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not just yet...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020006A0075007300740020007900650074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, get ’em. Can’t keep Volcanion waiting!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C0020006700650074002020190065006D002E002000430061006E201900740020006B00650065007000200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E002000770061006900740069006E0067002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Good for you, my brave little teacher’s pet. Now\nlet’s get going!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F006400200066006F007200200079006F0075002C0020006D00790020006200720061007600650020006C006900740074006C006500200074006500610063006800650072201900730020007000650074002E0020004E006F0077000A006C0065007420190073002000670065007400200067006F0069006E0067002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s just one minor problem.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’ve whacked together a device that should let us\nwipe out the virus, so we can open the Poké Ball<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwithout destroying it. But...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 171
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“But”?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201C004200750074201D003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uh-oh",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550068002D006F00680000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, since the Poké Ball’s got such a mighty\nPokémon in it, I had to use...creative methods<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto find a way to get the thing open.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI can basically guarantee that once Volcanion gets\nfree, you’re gonna be dealing with one angry,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npowerful opponent.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 259
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But you’ve got nothing to worry about, because I\nwent and called in a Volcanion expert to help us.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There are Volcanion experts?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500720065002000610072006500200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E00200065007800700065007200740073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You found someone like that?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200066006F0075006E006400200073006F006D0065006F006E00650020006C0069006B006500200074006800610074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m the Volcanion expert!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D002000740068006500200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E0020006500780070006500720074002100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve jogged through every street in this city, so I\nknew the quickest route here from Lumiose Press!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You remember Ms. Yvon from the Z-A Royale?\nWell, she’s an associate editor at Lumiose Press.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nShe found a top-secret memo about Volcanion!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The person who wrote this memo about the\nsecret of Volcanion’s power had this to say:<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“In order to cause a steam explosion powerful\nenough to blow up mountains, the Pokémon must<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhave an organ with extremely high temperature<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthat can instantly vaporize water into steam.”<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 284
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They also talk more about how great its power\ncan be—enough to change Kalos’s geography!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“In the southern part of the Kalos region, there\nseems to be a custom to revere Volcanion as a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nnation-building Pokémon.”<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhat’s more, “People seem to believe that a steam\nexplosion caused by Volcanion created the plain<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwhere they live.”<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 5528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 342
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It sounds ridiculously powerful!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 6212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007400200073006F0075006E006400730020007200690064006900630075006C006F00750073006C007900200070006F00770065007200660075006C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s true that there once was a huge mountain\nrange in southern Kalos...until it was obliterated<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nin a massive explosion of unknown origin.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 6288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Smells like Volcanion to me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 6580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006D0065006C006C00730020006C0069006B006500200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E00200074006F0020006D0065002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This isn’t making me thrilled about what could\nhappen when it gets out...but no matter what,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwe can’t just leave it stuck in a hacked Poké Ball.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 6648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 152
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So with that, I guess it’s time to introduce you to\nthis lab’s basement!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 6952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 7108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. You copy?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 7120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002C00200010000201000000002E00200059006F007500200063006F00700079003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yvon and I are gonna be cheering you on from\noutside that room!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 7172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590076006F006E00200061006E006400200049002000610072006500200067006F006E006E00610020006200650020006300680065006500720069006E006700200079006F00750020006F006E002000660072006F006D000A006F0075007400730069006400650020007400680061007400200072006F006F006D002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We would come in with you, but...y’know. We like\nstaying alive.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 7308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006500200077006F0075006C006400200063006F006D006500200069006E0020007700690074006800200079006F0075002C0020006200750074002E002E002E00792019006B006E006F0077002E0020005700650020006C0069006B0065000A00730074006100790069006E006700200061006C006900760065002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now toss out that Poké Ball with Volcanion in it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 7444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007700200074006F007300730020006F007500740020007400680061007400200050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C0020007700690074006800200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E00200069006E002000690074002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, that sure looks like one feisty opponent!\nGood luck in there!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 7552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C00200074006800610074002000730075007200650020006C006F006F006B00730020006C0069006B00650020006F006E006500200066006500690073007400790020006F00700070006F006E0065006E00740021000A0047006F006F00640020006C00750063006B00200069006E002000740068006500720065002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "VwwoooOOOAAARRR!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 7696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600770077006F006F006F004F004F004F00410041004100520052005200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 7732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Did you not hear me when I said to CATCH IT?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 7744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069006400200079006F00750020006E006F0074002000680065006100720020006D00650020007700680065006E002000490020007300610069006400200074006F002000430041005400430048002000490054003F002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 7844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ding-ding-ding! Yup, you did it! To the victor\ngoes...Volcanion!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069006E0067002D00640069006E0067002D00640069006E006700210020005900750070002C00200079006F00750020006400690064002000690074002100200054006F002000740068006500200076006900630074006F0072000A0067006F00650073002E002E002E0056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Strange how even the most riled-up Pokémon will\nchill out once you catch it, huh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 7996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿/",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 8168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My pulse is still racing from watching you go toe\nto toe with a Mythical Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 8180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If I could perhaps ask for one small favor in return\nfor the info I provided...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWould you mind letting Volcanion do away with\nsome parts of Lumiose? Just enough to clear a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nnice, long track for a marath—<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 8352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 213
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, no. That’s not happening.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 8780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C0020006E006F002E00200054006800610074201900730020006E006F0074002000680061007000700065006E0069006E0067002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I was only joking, of course!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnyway, I think I can get a fantastic article out of\nall this. My editor in chief won’t believe her eyes!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 8852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On that note, time to jog back to work. Lumiose\nPress won’t wait for me!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 9140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I kind of get how Volcanion must’ve felt, losing its\nfreedom thanks to Team Flare’s misdeeds...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNot that my gilded cage is exactly the same as\nbeing stuck in a hacked Poké Ball.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 9296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 185
    },
    {
      "displayText": "At least now Volcanion’s got a new partner!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 9668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100740020006C00650061007300740020006E006F007700200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E2019007300200067006F0074002000610020006E0065007700200070006100720074006E00650072002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You get to show it all kinds of interesting stuff to\nsee and do—the way only a Pokémon Trainer can.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 9764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve gotten to see some pretty neat things thanks\nto you and your buds, too, I guess. What a ride.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 9972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now get lost, kid! Till next time, maybe!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 10180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007700200067006500740020006C006F00730074002C0020006B006900640021002000540069006C006C0020006E006500780074002000740069006D0065002C0020006D0061007900620065002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    }
  ],
